## 1. Authentication APIs

### 1.1 Customer Signup
Register a new customer with personal details, PAN/Aadhaar document images, address, password, and optional referral code.

- **Endpoint:** `POST /api/customer/auth/signup`
- **Headers:** `Content-Type: application/json`

#### Request Body:
```json
{
  "name": "Md. Salim Ansari",
  "mobile": "9876543210",
  "email": "salim@example.com",
  "password": "cust123",
  "panNumber": "ABCDE1234F",
  "panImage": "data:image/jpeg;base64,... (or image URL)",
  "adhaarNumber": "2456 7890 1234",
  "adhaarImage": "data:image/jpeg;base64,... (or image URL)",
  "address": "14/B Park Circus, Kolkata",
  "pincode": "700017",
  "referralCode": "AGT-3601",
  "type": "Loan",
  "savingsBalance": 5000
}
```

#### Response (200 OK):
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Customer signup successful!",
  "data": {
    "customer": {
      "customerId": "CUS742",
      "name": "Md. Salim Ansari",
      "mobile": "9876543210",
      "email": "salim@example.com",
      "accountNumber": "MC360-9876543210",
      "debitCardNumber": "5421 9876 5432 1026",
      "debitCardExpiry": "09/31",
      "debitCardCvv": "834",
      "savingsBalance": 5000,
      "kycStatus": "Verified",
      "status": "Active",
      "referralCode": "AGT-3601",
      "documentsCount": 4
    },
    "token": "token_cust_1727239800000"
  }
}
```

---

### 1.2 Customer Login
Login to customer portal using Mobile Number, Email, Account Number, or Customer ID with password.

- **Endpoint:** `POST /api/customer/auth/login`
- **Headers:** `Content-Type: application/json`

#### Request Body:
```json
{
  "identifier": "9876543210",
  "password": "cust123"
}
```
*(Note: `identifier` can be mobile `9876543210`, email `salim@example.com`, or account no `MC360-9876543210`)*

#### Response (200 OK):
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "customer": {
      "customerId": "CUS001",
      "name": "Md. Salim Ansari",
      "mobile": "9876543210",
      "email": "salim@example.com",
      "accountNumber": "MC360-9876543210",
      "debitCardNumber": "5421 8812 9876 5432",
      "debitCardExpiry": "09/31",
      "debitCardCvv": "834",
      "savingsBalance": 34500,
      "kycStatus": "Verified"
    },
    "token": "jwt_cust_CUS001"
  }
}
```

---

## 2. Customer Profile & Data APIs

### 2.1 Get Customer Full Dashboard Data
Fetch complete customer profile, Virtual Debit Card info, active Loans (including Daily Loan), Investments (FD/RD/MIS), Collection receipts, and Late Payment penalty chart.

- **Endpoint:** `GET /api/customer/data?customerId=CUS001`
- **Query Parameters:**
  - `customerId` (optional): Customer ID, mobile number, or account number (defaults to logged-in customer)

#### Response (200 OK):
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "customer": {
      "customerId": "CUS001",
      "name": "Md. Salim Ansari",
