## 6. Razorpay Payment Gateway APIs

### 6.1 Verify Razorpay Payment & Auto Credit Agent Commission
Verifies an online payment transaction made through Razorpay (Savings Deposit, EMI Payment, Daily Installment, or FD/RD Opening), creates the official collection receipt in MongoDB, and automatically calculates & credits the linked Agent's commission into their wallet.

- **Endpoint:** `POST /api/payments/razorpay/verify`
- **Headers:** `Content-Type: application/json`

#### Request Body:
```json
{
  "paymentId": "pay_rzp_1727239900",
  "orderId": "order_rzp_1727239900",
  "customerId": "CUS001",
  "customerName": "Md. Salim Ansari",
  "amount": 5000,
  "type": "DEPOSIT",
  "schemeCode": "SCH-FD-01",
  "loanId": "LN001",
  "accountId": "FD001"
}
```
*(Types supported: `DEPOSIT`, `EMI`, `DAILY_LOAN`, `FD`, `RD`, `MIS`)*

#### Response (200 OK):
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Razorpay payment verified & automatically collected!",
  "data": {
    "receiptNo": "RC824",
    "paymentId": "pay_rzp_1727239900",
    "amount": 5000,
    "agentCommissionCredited": 100,
    "agentName": "Rakesh Kumar"
  }
}
```

