## 8. Document Upload API (KYC)

### 8.1 Upload Document (Amazon S3 / Local Metadata)
- **Endpoint:** `POST /api/s3/upload`
- **Payload:** `multipart/form-data` with `file`, `entityType: "customer"`, `entityId: "CUS001"`
- **Response (200 OK):**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "fileKey": "kyc/cust_pan_9876543210.jpg",
    "s3Url": "https://multicredit-documents.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/kyc/cust_pan_9876543210.jpg"
  }
}
```

